This movies app was created from the inspiration of Sam Barros. 
An online guide on how to make this app can be found on this website: 
https://medium.com/swlh/how-to-create-your-first-mern-mongodb-express-js-react-js-and-node-js-stack-7e8b20463e66.

The overall tutorial involves building a app with MERN or mongodb, express, react and node js. 
